<title>USA: HMT Technology sees lower than expected Q3.</title>
<headline>HMT Technology sees lower than expected Q3.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>HMT Technology Corp said on Tuesday that due to lower than anticipated shipments to a customer, revenue and earnings results will be below consensus expectations for the quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>HMT is a manufacturer of media for use with advanced head technologies.</p>
<p>The company did not predict what revenue and earnings would be.</p>
</text>
